SUMMARY:Artist Talk: Contemporary Myths: The Stories That Build\, Unite\, a
 nd Divide
LOCATION:Dallas Contemporary
URL:https://letsdoitdallas.com/?date=2026-11-19&e=artist-talk-contemporary-
 myths-the-stories-that-build-unite-and-divide%7Cdallas-contemporary-dallas
 %7C6-00-pm-7-00-pm
DESCRIPTION:This conversation examines the enduring role of myth and storyt
 elling in making sense of existential questions and the uncertainty of a r
 apidly changing world. The discussion explores how narrative can shape our
  understanding of cultural change\, human experience\, and the future. —
  More: https://letsdoitdallas.com/free-events/
END:VEVENT
